          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Consider the following polynomial division:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-2 \\\\  & x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+8x-5\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{2}+10x}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-2x-10}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the above, what is $\\dfrac{2x^2+8x-5}{x+5}?$",
